{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1589.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"bff8d2f14192becc4f86fbf97588f0a47e924852c81a36a0fc1333ae86c0e68d","ja":"先ほどの女の子、朋花さんのことを、\n心から尊敬しているみたいでしたね♪","zh":"刚才那个女孩子，看起来是发自内心地\n尊敬着朋花呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1589.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"7dc3d57c79005a9fe69202e85b10cce0cbb42a81681045c7755a84dfa6c1c259","ja":"うふふ♪\n聖母冥利につきるといったところでしょうか～。","zh":"呵呵♪\n真可以说是作为圣母的无上荣幸呢～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1589.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"5bd9c76ccc0ddfcb61cec117c530abe03a93b2dd79088f84f2887a7a0c07fcf7","ja":"きっとこの後の舞台も、あの子にとって\n特別な思い出になるでしょうね……。","zh":"接下来的舞台，对那个孩子来说\n也一定会成为特别的回忆吧……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1589.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"f1f252f4e0427870aa852699245ab96a47fa5e40ac167f0af2dd229bb9d777e7","ja":"あら～？　なんだか他人事のようですけど……\nエミリーちゃんに憧れている子もいましたよ～？","zh":"哎呀～？感觉你好像事不关己的样子……\n其实也有很崇拜艾米莉的孩子哦～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1589.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"b3fef8f215afd6df5f708ba5718f24f81272e6f882395ae1d958855c129ad252","ja":"あっ……！　そうですね、\n私も会えてうれしいと言ってもらえました！","zh":"啊……！是啊，\n对方也对我说，能见到我很高兴！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1589.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"771e79c36e502de4661230252f9e07236e6c6f63ab77615a366e4e337b044b68","ja":"その憧れに恥じないよう、堂々とした舞台を\nみなさんにお見せしないといけませんね！","zh":"为了不辜负这份向往，我必须向大家\n展现出堂堂正正的舞台才行呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1589.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"62f2412c2e3e23c6f78c16611ca159a4d4609fd1d76ce71d891dabf53def4ce8","ja":"はい～。特別なステージを、\nしっかり堪能してもらいましょう～。","zh":"好的～就让他们好好\n尽情享受特别的舞台吧～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1589.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"f16e5b3726a2f2f3dc75ad500a8575381aae2651133bf3ec1f069e5e44f18241","ja":"「まもなく、朋花さん、エミリーさんのスペシャル\nライブが始まります。生徒のみなさんは体育館に……」","zh":"“朋花同学、艾米莉同学的特别演出\n马上就要开始了。请各位同学前往体育馆……”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1589.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"048557fc73d2b59665f41fa4f9e374ab0f11d3e4550bdf65340a568d03f9cd2a","ja":"一週間後……","zh":"一周后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1589.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"daecb7da3408b4c7df0896784494f70afc69203dcfe533ca135315cc16cc3a8b","ja":"あ、朋花さん！　先ほど仕掛け人さまが、\nお手紙をたくさん届けてくださったんですよ！","zh":"啊，朋花小姐！刚才制作人先生\n送来了好多信件哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1589.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"f89ebeb073ef68cac801d4f0e7bf9d79ad7b7f406029d3315a74a8bcbdaa4193","ja":"これは……この前、サプライズ企画でお訪ねした\n学校のみなさんからですね～？","zh":"这是……之前为了惊喜企划前去拜访的\n那所学校的大家送来的吧～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
